<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Integon cut by Legg Mason.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Integon cut by Legg Mason.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Legg Mason Wood Walker analyst Diana Wehrly said she cut her rating on Integon Corp to market perform from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Cited disappointing fourth quarter results. Company reported fourth quarter operating loss of $1.14 a share compared with the First Call consensus of a profit of $0.39 a share.</p>
<p>-- Stock was delayed at the opening for an order imbalance. Stock closed Wednesday at 17-1/2.</p>
</text>
